<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GoldenHandz Agri & Media LLC | Land Stewardship & Permaculture</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #121614;
            --card-bg: #1a221e;
            --accent-gold: #d4af37;
            --accent-green: #2e5a27;
            --text-main: #e2e8f0;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #2e3d33;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        header {
            background-color: var(--accent-green);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 30px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .location-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--border-color);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        section {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
            padding-left: 12px;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        ul {
            list-style-type: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        ul li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        ul li::before {
            content: "•";
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: bold;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-candles: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .gallery img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>GoldenHandz</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Agriculture & Media Soulutions</div>
            <div class="location-badge">Technical Agri-Sovereignty • Soil Rejuvenation • Empowered Media</div>
        </header>

        <section>
            <h2>Mission Statement</h2>
            <p>Bridging physical land stewardship, microclimate intelligence, and open-source media on the Big Island of Hawaiʻi. GoldenHandz is dedicated to reclaiming local food independence, revitalizing soil biology, and transforming overgrown spaces into low-maintenance, high-yield ecosystems. We honor pre-existing structural assets and work in harmony with Pacific volcanic microclimates to cultivate mind, body, spirit, and land.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Field Work & Gallery</h2>
            <p>From terraced bed creation to integrating high-vitality crops straight into the earth's natural circuit—transforming vision into tangible living reality.</p>
            
            <div class="gallery">
                <img src="3915.jpg" alt="Land clearing and biomass staging">
                <img src="3917.jpg" alt="Terraced soil prep and stewardship">
                <img src="3959.jpg" alt="Active garden growth and rock alignment">
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
            &copy; 2026 GoldenHandz Agri & Media LLC. All Rights Reserved.
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

